{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1074176-roll20-character-sheets","id":1074176,"title":"Roll20 character sheets","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-04-06T09:11:45-07:00","id":1074176,"title":"Roll20 character sheets","content":"So, as some of you may know. Roll20 was recently licensed to create &quot;official&quot; CofD character sheets. I've used them and I can tell you that they work really well and the production value is high. Unfortunately, when it comes to 2nd Edition, the only available variations on the sheet are VtR and WtF. Not only that, but when I contacted the developers for Roll20, I was told that its not high on the priority list right now. I'm really disappointed that they haven't gotten around to adding DtD, PtC 2nd, MtAW 2nd, or BtP. The CSS and HTML for the official sheet is up on GitHub to be reverse engineered for anyone willing to create a custom sheet. Is there ANYONE out there with experience in front end web development (CSS, html, etc) that could create those sheets? I'd even be willing to pay someone to do it (though probably nowhere near as much as what your time is worth).<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://github.com/Roll20/roll20-character-sheets/tree/master/New%20World%20of%20Darkness%20Official\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/Roll20/roll20-cha...ess%20Official</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1702,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1702-matty1love","user":"Matty1Love","date":". 04-06-2017, 12:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1702-matty1love","name":"Matty1Love","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"43"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-06T09:25:28-07:00","id":1074185,"title":"","content":"Its not surprising that it's a low priority for them. CofD is a pretty niche game, and its heavier focus on social interaction rather than tactical grid combat makes it not as well suited to virtual tabletops like roll20 as combat focused games like D&amp;D. I don't imagine it's very popular on roll20, unfortunately.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-06T09:47:37-07:00","id":1074198,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1074176-roll20-character-sheets?p=1074185#post1074185\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Its not surprising that it's a low priority for them. CofD is a pretty niche game, and its heavier focus on social interaction rather than tactical grid combat makes it not as well suited to virtual tabletops like roll20 as combat focused games like D&amp;D. I don't imagine it's very popular on roll20, unfortunately.</div> </div> </div> </div>While its popularity is definitely not on par with D&amp;D, Pathfinder, etc., I have never had trouble finding a full table for a CofD or WoD game. You post a game on there, there will be people interested. And, like I said, the sheets work very well. The built in dice mechanics are pretty much flawless. Its really a shame bc its nearly impossible for me to find a game locally.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1702-matty1love","name":"Matty1Love","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"43"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-06T10:17:10-07:00","id":1074212,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Matty1Love</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1074176-roll20-character-sheets?p=1074198#post1074198\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> While its popularity is definitely not on par with D&amp;D, Pathfinder, etc., I have never had trouble finding a full table for a CofD or WoD game. You post a game on there, there will be people interested. And, like I said, the sheets work very well. The built in dice mechanics are pretty much flawless. Its really a shame bc its nearly impossible for me to find a game locally.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh yeah, there's definitely a community for it. And I'm sure the official sheets are great tools, if the D&amp;D 5e ones are any indication. Just saying, I'm not surprised CofD 2e sheets aren't a high priority for them, due to the games relative popularity. Anyway, best of luck on finding help whipping up some unofficial ones.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-06T10:36:39-07:00","id":1074225,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Matty1Love</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1074176-roll20-character-sheets#post1074176\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, as some of you may know. Roll20 was recently licensed to create &quot;official&quot; CofD character sheets. I've used them and I can tell you that they work really well and the production value is high. Unfortunately, when it comes to 2nd Edition, the only available variations on the sheet are VtR and WtF. Not only that, but when I contacted the developers for Roll20, I was told that its not high on the priority list right now. I'm really disappointed that they haven't gotten around to adding DtD, PtC 2nd, MtAW 2nd, or BtP. The CSS and HTML for the official sheet is up on GitHub to be reverse engineered for anyone willing to create a custom sheet. Is there ANYONE out there with experience in front end web development (CSS, html, etc) that could create those sheets? I'd even be willing to pay someone to do it (though probably nowhere near as much as what your time is worth).<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://github.com/Roll20/roll20-character-sheets/tree/master/New%20World%20of%20Darkness%20Official\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/Roll20/roll20-cha...ess%20Official</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Heya - I also use the sheet accordingly - Beautiful sheets but the lack of updates is disappointing. I very much contacted Steve K. , the dev for the sheet and got a similar response. I would like the additions that you suggest and more if possible...but I'm not sure how :/ - I'd also be willing to chip in for it in terms of $ because I desperately love Roll20 and want to use the sheets to the fullest.<br /> <br /> I've contacted other sheet Devs on Roll 20 and suffice to say - I guess it's complicated because they weren't able to help much :/ <br /> <br /> I made a thread in the character sheet section on Roll 20 - so hoping this thread plus that gains any traction.<br /> <br /> Looking on a potential brightside - In December, in the Meeting Notes, there was a response accordingly - <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Next, I have a request from Val, our Extended Media Coordinator, for any of you who play on-line on venues like </span></span></span><b>Roll20</b><span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">, or </span></span></span><b>Fantasy Grounds</b><span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">, or over </span></span></span><b>Skype</b><span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"> or something similar. What sort of projects do you think we could/should/need to do that you would use as you play on-line? We can see what other companies have created for online gaming, but what are YOU looking for?</span></span></span><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/looking-back-the-onyx-path-2016-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://theonyxpath.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/OPP-Metal.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/looking-back-the-onyx-path-2016-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\"> Looking Back the Onyx Path: 2016 [Monday Meeting Notes] &ndash; Onyx Path Publishing </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/looking-back-the-onyx-path-2016-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://theonyxpath.com/looking-back-the-onyx-path-2016-monday-meeting-notes/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Hopefully...Hopefully - eventually Onyx Path can get some devs to update those sheets. One has hope - Suffice to say I hear your struggles; I'm playing a crossover game in 2E but the lack of updates ar <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11457-volke","name":"Volke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11457_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"127"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-06T13:17:46-07:00","id":1074292,"title":"","content":"I also wish they'd make a sheet for ephemeral entities.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: the Ascension - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1191028-redesigned-prime-sphere\" target=\"_blank\">Redesigned Prime Sphere</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1188769-simpler-wonder-creation\" target=\"_blank\">Streamlined Wonder Creation</a><br /> Mummy: the Curse - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/474927-mummy-the-curse-2e-conversion\" target=\"_blank\">Lightweight 2E Conversion</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/22378-second-sight-tradition-disciples-of-duat\" target=\"_blank\">Disciples of Duat</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/61-octavo","name":"Octavo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar61_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-06T15:42:44-07:00","id":1074362,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Octavo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1074176-roll20-character-sheets?p=1074292#post1074292\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I also wish they'd make a sheet for ephemeral entities.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Here's hoping....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11457-volke","name":"Volke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11457_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"127"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-11T11:16:48-07:00","id":1076593,"title":"","content":"I don't know how much time I'll have (fulltime job and side business + gaming) but I am experienced with front end development so I might be able to work on these some on the occasional weekend. No promises though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-11T12:00:52-07:00","id":1076611,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Volke</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1074176-roll20-character-sheets?p=1074362#post1074362\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Here's hoping....</div> </div> </div> </div>Me too. I'm running a Mage/Promethean/mortals crossover, and I sorely need updated, 2nd Edition sheets.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/216-zooroos","name":"Zooroos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar216_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"250"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-30T10:33:23-07:00","id":1085820,"title":"","content":"Finally pulled the repo, starting to make some updates...<br /> <br /> Update:<br /> All the functional changes are done for adding second editions of every game line that has one as well as Demon and Beast.<br /> <br /> Remaining work:<br /> <br /> Add backgrounds for new games<br /> Add title images for new games<br /> Test to be sure its all working correctly (not sure how to do this yet)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":1329,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","user":"ElvesofZion","date":". 04-30-2017, 03:24 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-30T16:20:09-07:00","id":1085936,"title":"","content":"sweet. Just a FYI, someone did post a CofD (NWoD Official) Character Sheet including the Beast the Primordial option in the 2nd edition. I can verify it works, however, I had to actually had to code everything into it myself as something was screwed with it when they imported it into their github. If you want me to upload I can.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Kinda I want to&quot; - Trent Reznor<br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://scontent.ftpa1-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t1.0-9/27973518_2040009129348529_5319855605701568493_n.jpg?oh=9c85c5c9d4a0769a1249ea2f3e62ca43&amp;oe=5B002AA5\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12143-eldritchminister","name":"EldritchMinister","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12143_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-30T17:23:42-07:00","id":1085956,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>EldritchMinister</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1074176-roll20-character-sheets?p=1085936#post1085936\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">sweet. Just a FYI, someone did post a CofD (NWoD Official) Character Sheet including the Beast the Primordial option in the 2nd edition. I can verify it works, however, I had to actually had to code everything into it myself as something was screwed with it when they imported it into their github. If you want me to upload I can.</div> </div> </div> </div>Can you? I just popped into my roll 20 but it wasn't updated <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> .<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11457-volke","name":"Volke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11457_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"127"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-30T17:25:28-07:00","id":1085958,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ElvesofZion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1074176-roll20-character-sheets?p=1085820#post1085820\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Finally pulled the repo, starting to make some updates...<br /> <br /> Update:<br /> All the functional changes are done for adding second editions of every game line that has one as well as Demon and Beast.<br /> <br /> Remaining work:<br /> <br /> Add backgrounds for new games<br /> Add title images for new games<br /> Test to be sure its all working correctly (not sure how to do this yet)</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Omg thank youuuu - Question though is how do I get it up - It hasn't updated on my end - It's the one done by Steve K. right?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11457-volke","name":"Volke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11457_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"127"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-30T17:41:09-07:00","id":1085965,"title":"","content":"I am running Mage 2E on Roll20 and character sheets are definitely an issue. How do we go about using your updated character sheets \u200b<b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion\">ElvesofZion</a>?</b>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>I game. This is the way.</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8-storyteller","name":"Storyteller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-30T17:57:09-07:00","id":1085974,"title":"","content":"Once i finish the next bit, I have to submit them to roll20 and they have to merge them in. I have no idea how long that could take.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11457-volke\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar11457_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"11457\" data-vbnamecard=\"11457\">Volke</a>, I am modifying the 'Official' ones by Steve K. , yes but they wont be in the system yet.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12143-eldritchminister\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12143_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12143\" data-vbnamecard=\"12143\">EldritchMinister</a>, is that posted to the roll20 github? or their personal one?<br /> <br /> Update:<br /> <br /> Pull request is made. It is up to roll20 to accept it now. I didn't change the 'Official' in my copy so they may ask me to change that before it goes in.<br /> <br /> I did change it to Chronicles of Darkness instead of nWoD though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":1329,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","user":"ElvesofZion","date":". 04-30-2017, 09:56 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-01T06:08:51-07:00","id":1086159,"title":"","content":"ElvesofZion, it is posted in a user's personal. The link can be found in the Roll20 Forums under the Character Sheets and Compendium section. In fact, here is the link to the github of the user. Just to note, I had to compare the two and add all lines for the Beast the Primordial Character Sheet myself to the &quot;Official&quot; NWoD sheet (just copy and paste it as 'custom'). There were some minor additions to the html and css files respectively. <a href=\"https://github.com/dev824804/Beast-Primordial\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/dev824804/Beast-Primordial</a><br /> <br /> Not sure why I had to actually add everything myself manually instead of just copying and pasting it into the 'custom' html and css areas, but It was really screwy when I did, so it was easier to just add the necessary code myself rather than debugging. <br /> <br /> On top of that, if you need anything else on my end (testing the sheet, etc.) let me know as I'm happy to help!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Kinda I want to&quot; - Trent Reznor<br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://scontent.ftpa1-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t1.0-9/27973518_2040009129348529_5319855605701568493_n.jpg?oh=9c85c5c9d4a0769a1249ea2f3e62ca43&amp;oe=5B002AA5\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":12143,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12143-eldritchminister","user":"EldritchMinister","date":".  adding notes 05-01-2017, 09:15 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12143-eldritchminister","name":"EldritchMinister","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12143_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-01T14:28:34-07:00","id":1086334,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ElvesofZion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1074176-roll20-character-sheets?p=1085974#post1085974\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Once i finish the next bit, I have to submit them to roll20 and they have to merge them in. I have no idea how long that could take.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11457-volke\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar11457_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"11457\" data-vbnamecard=\"11457\">Volke</a>, I am modifying the 'Official' ones by Steve K. , yes but they wont be in the system yet.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12143-eldritchminister\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12143_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12143\" data-vbnamecard=\"12143\">EldritchMinister</a>, is that posted to the roll20 github? or their personal one?<br /> <br /> Update:<br /> <br /> Pull request is made. It is up to roll20 to accept it now. I didn't change the 'Official' in my copy so they may ask me to change that before it goes in.<br /> <br /> I did change it to Chronicles of Darkness instead of nWoD though.</div> </div> </div> </div>Excellnt! Let us know if there is anything we can do - &lt;3s You are a deity!<br /> <br /> Also - Is there anything I as a GM need to do to update sheet once the sheet is accepted?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11457,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11457-volke","user":"Volke","date":". 05-01-2017, 05:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11457-volke","name":"Volke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11457_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"127"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-02T08:00:13-07:00","id":1086635,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1329_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1329\" data-vbnamecard=\"1329\">ElvesofZion</a> I've noticed something in the official sheets perhaps you could look into. When using the dice roller icon at the top right corner of the sheet, the Gnosis trait never shows up for the automated roll, regardless of its trait being highlighted or not. I suspect it's the same with the rest of the power traits, but I haven't checked it myself. If you can do anything about it, it would be wonderful.<br /> <br /> Also, thank you for picking up the torch and giving us 2nd ed sheets!!!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/216-zooroos","name":"Zooroos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar216_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"250"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-02T19:52:02-07:00","id":1086962,"title":"","content":"Status Update:<br /> <br /> Since I renamed the sheet to Chronicles, they dont want it to be a near duplicate of the other sheet. I am hoping that it can be changed so that the &quot;Official&quot; Sheet has my changes and the correct name. I'll work on that.<br /> <br /> I don't have a pro account, so if anyone wants to test my sheets and let me know if there are any issues with the new parts, that'd be useful. Here's a link to my repo: <a href=\"https://github.com/ElvesofZion/roll20-character-sheets\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/ElvesofZion/roll20-character-sheets</a><br /> <br /> If anyone wants to gather the background images for hunter, beast and demon I can add those too (they currently just use the mortals one).<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/216-zooroos\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar216_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"216\" data-vbnamecard=\"216\">Zooroos</a>, I'll see about that kind of thing in the future but I want to get them accepted first.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T18:30:26-07:00","id":1087441,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ElvesofZion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1074176-roll20-character-sheets?p=1086962#post1086962\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Status Update:<br /> <br /> Since I renamed the sheet to Chronicles, they dont want it to be a near duplicate of the other sheet. I am hoping that it can be changed so that the &quot;Official&quot; Sheet has my changes and the correct name. I'll work on that.<br /> <br /> I don't have a pro account, so if anyone wants to test my sheets and let me know if there are any issues with the new parts, that'd be useful. Here's a link to my repo: <a href=\"https://github.com/ElvesofZion/roll20-character-sheets\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/ElvesofZion/roll20-character-sheets</a><br /> <br /> If anyone wants to gather the background images for hunter, beast and demon I can add those too (they currently just use the mortals one).<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/216-zooroos\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar216_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"216\" data-vbnamecard=\"216\">Zooroos</a>, I'll see about that kind of thing in the future but I want to get them accepted first.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> You are amazing Elves &lt;3, If your browsing on the marketplace for anything - send me a PM on Roll 20, not even joking - I've been waiting to this for so long know <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />. Thank you for picking up the mantle so much !<br /> <br /> So I do have a Pro account so I was able to try it out - it works excellently.<br /> <br /> In terms of the background images - How exactly are you gathering them? Would there be anyway to use Mr. Gone's blank sheets? I'll help if I can for anything.<br /> <br /> Also just a few brief suggestion:<br /> <br /> On the PtC 2E sheet - I think you could have just &quot;pilgrimage&quot; like the actual 2e character sheet has instead of &quot;humanity pilgrimage&quot; - makes it more streamlined (unless there is a reason for this.)<br /> <br /> In regards to <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/216-zooroos\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar216_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"216\" data-vbnamecard=\"216\">Zooroos</a> and his comment - You are indeed the case for all the supernatural power traits (Blood Potency, Azoth, Wyrd, etc.)<br /> <br /> Also I'm not going to start questioning or suggesting things since you are just trying to get it accepted - it would be cool to have a NPC section for things like Ephemeral Beings &amp; Horrors down the line.<br /> <br /> Tldr - Great work <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11457,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11457-volke","user":"Volke","date":"Spelling 05-03-2017, 09:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11457-volke","name":"Volke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11457_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"127"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T18:34:21-07:00","id":1087442,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1074176-roll20-character-sheets?p=1074185#post1074185\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Its not surprising that it's a low priority for them. CofD is a pretty niche game, and its heavier focus on social interaction rather than tactical grid combat makes it not as well suited to virtual tabletops like roll20 as combat focused games like D&amp;D. I don't imagine it's very popular on roll20, unfortunately.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is indeed the case - It has a community like you said but it is quite low priority <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> .<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://68.media.tumblr.com/f9bd17eeefb0b49c68dabef8e110f552/tumblr_inline_ooxlo2Dwas1tmt2jn_500.png\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://68.media.tumblr.com/f9bd17eeefb0b49c68dabef8e110f552/tumblr_inline_ooxlo2Dwas1tmt2jn_500.png\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://68.media.tumblr.com/f9bd17eeefb0b49c68dabef8e110f552/tumblr_inline_ooxlo2Dwas1tmt2jn_500.png\" target=\"_blank\"> http://68.media.tumblr.com/f9bd17eeefb0b49c68dabef8e110f552/tumblr_inline_ooxlo2Dwas1tmt2jn_500.png </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11457-volke","name":"Volke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11457_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"127"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T19:11:07-07:00","id":1087460,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Volke</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1074176-roll20-character-sheets?p=1087441#post1087441\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> In terms of the background images - How exactly are you gathering them? Would there be anyway to use Mr. Gone's blank sheets? I'll help if I can for anything.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Any image would work, if Mr. Gone has them as pdfs with just the background then I can convert those to a suitable format fine. I was just too lazy to hunt the files myself.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Volke</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1074176-roll20-character-sheets?p=1087441#post1087441\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also just a few brief suggestion:<br /> <br /> On the PtC 2E sheet - I think you could have just &quot;pilgrimage&quot; like the actual 2e character sheet has instead of &quot;humanity pilgrimage&quot; - makes it more streamlined (unless there is a reason for this.)</div> </div> </div> </div>Sounds like a bug. It should just be pilgrimage. I'm not sure I used the system right on that one... Can you check hunter and mortal? Do they say &quot;Morality Integrity&quot; for 2nd ed or just &quot;Integrity&quot; (those three are the only ones that changed names for that stat between editions).<br /> <br /> FYI, Looks like i need to change the name back on portions to get it accepted for now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T19:58:35-07:00","id":1087477,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ElvesofZion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1074176-roll20-character-sheets?p=1087460#post1087460\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Any image would work, if Mr. Gone has them as pdfs with just the background then I can convert those to a suitable format fine. I was just too lazy to hunt the files myself.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Sounds like a bug. It should just be pilgrimage. I'm not sure I used the system right on that one... Can you check hunter and mortal? Do they say &quot;Morality Integrity&quot; for 2nd ed or just &quot;Integrity&quot; (those three are the only ones that changed names for that stat between editions).<br /> <br /> FYI, Looks like i need to change the name back on portions to get it accepted for now.</div> </div> </div> </div>It just says Integrity for Mortal, and Morality for HtV. <br /> <br /> Here's Mr.Gone's Site - <a href=\"https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/</a> (Thank you Mr. Gone &lt;3 )<br /> <br /> Under HTV - maybe the Interactive Sheet would be appropriate for example if converted.<br /> <br /> For Beast &amp; Demon - I'm sure if you ask the devs, they could get you the image for the character sheet borders without much difficulty.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11457-volke","name":"Volke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/ava