:""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-26T09:53:21-07:00","id":1097170,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>EldritchMinister</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1074176-roll20-character-sheets?p=1097162#post1097162\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I just wanted to make sure I wasn't the only one. thanks! I'll work on why on my end too because at one point I had the Beast logo working, not sure what has changed to not make it work, but I'll see if I can get it working too.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well I'm glad that I'm not the only one with this problem <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />. Let me know if you make any headway into it!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11457-volke","name":"Volke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11457_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"127"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-09T17:34:52-07:00","id":1113956,"title":"","content":"Ok, I know it has been awhile but I have finally gotten back to the sheets. I think I have fixed the issue with Humanity and Pilgrimage both showing for Promethean 2nd. Can someone with a Pro account load up my latest version an give it a try?<br /> <br /> Update:<br /> <br /> I also have made it so that selecting a 2nd Ed game makes it Lower + Athletics for Defense by default (it also switches back of you select a 1st Ed line).<br /> <br /> Update 2:<br /> <br /> And now I should have fixed the logos for Hunter, Demon, and Beast not appearing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":1329,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","user":"ElvesofZion","date":". 07-09-2017, 11:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-10T07:48:46-07:00","id":1114152,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ElvesofZion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1074176-roll20-character-sheets?p=1113956#post1113956\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ok, I know it has been awhile but I have finally gotten back to the sheets. I think I have fixed the issue with Humanity and Pilgrimage both showing for Promethean 2nd. Can someone with a Pro account load up my latest version an give it a try?<br /> <br /> Update:<br /> <br /> I also have made it so that selecting a 2nd Ed game makes it Lower + Athletics for Defense by default (it also switches back of you select a 1st Ed line).<br /> <br /> Update 2:<br /> <br /> And now I should have fixed the logos for Hunter, Demon, and Beast not appearing.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Alright so - I just popped into my campaign - I'm not sure if the changes went through as I'm still facing all the above issues. But that might be because I've tinkered with the character sheet in the past. But other than that...nothing seems to have changed <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> .<br /> <br /> Edit: Also I am a Pro Account.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11457,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11457-volke","user":"Volke","date":".  Forgot to say - 07-10-2017, 10:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11457-volke","name":"Volke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11457_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"127"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-10T08:09:05-07:00","id":1114158,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Volke</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1074176-roll20-character-sheets?p=1114152#post1114152\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Alright so - I just popped into my campaign - I'm not sure if the changes went through as I'm still facing all the above issues. But that might be because I've tinkered with the character sheet in the past. But other than that...nothing seems to have changed <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> .<br /> <br /> Edit: Also I am a Pro Account.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Did you grab the new version from my GitHub? I haven't pushed the changes to the official version yet. I wanted them to be tested first.<br /> <br /> The reason for the Pro account is to use the Custom Sheet option and load the sheets downloaded from my GitHub.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-10T14:24:20-07:00","id":1114278,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ElvesofZion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1074176-roll20-character-sheets?p=1114158#post1114158\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Did you grab the new version from my GitHub? I haven't pushed the changes to the official version yet. I wanted them to be tested first.<br /> <br /> The reason for the Pro account is to use the Custom Sheet option and load the sheets downloaded from my GitHub.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Ah gotcha - No I didn't - my bad.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11457-volke","name":"Volke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11457_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"127"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-11T07:44:16-07:00","id":1114581,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Volke</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1074176-roll20-character-sheets?p=1114278#post1114278\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Ah gotcha - No I didn't - my bad.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> No problem. I just wanted to clear up any confusion. If anyone can load them that way and test them it would be great. Since I don;t have a Pro account I can't fully test that my changes are working myself. I'll submit them to update the official version ones I know I am actually improving things.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-10T19:21:43-07:00","id":1205438,"title":"","content":"Is there some update on the status of the updates of the character sheet? I've been using it for a CofD game and it's very good but have some issues:<br /> 1) I didn't find a way to roll initiative so I had to create a macro for it<br /> 2) I didn't find a way to configure iron stamina<br /> <br /> I'm a software developer so I may be able to make some contributions to get this done <br /> <br /> Regards","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24077-kurviak","name":"kurviak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24077_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-11T09:22:46-07:00","id":1205628,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>kurviak</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1074176-roll20-character-sheets?p=1205438#post1205438\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is there some update on the status of the updates of the character sheet? I've been using it for a CofD game and it's very good but have some issues:<br /> 1) I didn't find a way to roll initiative so I had to create a macro for it<br /> 2) I didn't find a way to configure iron stamina<br /> <br /> I'm a software developer so I may be able to make some contributions to get this done<br /> <br /> Regards</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I don't have a Pro account so had been relying on others to test changes I made. Nobody was reporting to me that they had tried the last batch of changes so I never put in the Pull Request for them.<br /> <br /> I was not the originator of the sheets, so if you want to make improvements then go for it. If you test my versions and find issues I should still be able to help with them in some of my spare time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-13T15:25:25-07:00","id":1206684,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"b